6:[["$","$L12",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 prose prose-invert","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-6","children":[["$","$L13",null,{"href":"/","children":"Accueil"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","$L13",null,{"href":"/agent-ia","children":"Agent IA"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Coût d'un agent IA en 2026 : tarifs et ROI"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-4","children":"Coût d'un agent IA en 2026 : tarifs et ROI"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-12","children":["Publié le ","14/05/2026"," · ",13," min de lecture"," · ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":"coût agent ia"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["En 2026, ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/solutions/agent-sur-mesure","children":"déployer un agent IA"}]," en entreprise coûte entre ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"490 € et plusieurs dizaines de milliers d'euros"}]," selon le périmètre. Un agent sur un cas d'usage cadré (support entrant, qualification de leads) revient typiquement à ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"490–1 500 € de setup"}]," et ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"250–700 €/mois"}]," d'abonnement. Les projets orchestrés multi-agents ou sur mesure dépassent souvent ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"5 000 € de setup"}]," avec des mensualités variables selon l'infrastructure et le volume de requêtes."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"ce-que-coûte-réellement-un-agent-ia-en-entreprise-en-2026","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ce-que-coûte-réellement-un-agent-ia-en-entreprise-en-2026","children":"Ce que coûte réellement un agent IA en entreprise en 2026"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Le coût total d'un agent IA se décompose en trois postes principaux : les frais d'initialisation (setup), l'abonnement mensuel récurrent et les coûts de maintenance évolutive."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fourchettes observées en 2026 :"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Setup"}]," : de 490 € (périmètre cadré, un seul agent) à 5 000 €+ (architecture multi-agents, intégrations complexes)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Abonnement mensuel"}]," : de 249 €/mois (offre pilote) à 690 €/mois et au-delà pour des squads d'agents orchestrés"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Maintenance et évolutions"}]," : estimée entre 10 % et 20 % du coût annuel total, souvent sous-évaluée en phase de cadrage"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Infrastructure LLM"}]," (tokens, API) : variable selon le volume, de quelques dizaines à plusieurs centaines d'euros par mois"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ce que ces chiffres incluent généralement :"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Paramétrage et prompt engineering initial"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Intégrations aux outils métier (CRM, helpdesk, ERP)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Suivi des performances et ajustements post-lancement"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["À titre de comparaison, le coût annuel complet d'un agent IA sur périmètre pilote tourne autour de ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"3 500–5 000 €"}],", contre 35 000–50 000 € pour un équivalent temps plein humain sur les mêmes tâches répétitives."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"les-4-composantes-du-coût-dun-agent-ia","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#les-4-composantes-du-coût-dun-agent-ia","children":"Les 4 composantes du coût d'un agent IA"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Le budget total d'un agent IA en entreprise se répartit sur quatre postes distincts. Les ignorer, c'est s'exposer à des dépassements significatifs dès les premiers mois de déploiement."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"id":"1-infrastructure-llm-modèle-de-langage","children":"$L14"}],"\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61"]}],"$L62","$L63","$L64","$L65"]}],"$L66"]
